CSS parsing tests
=================

Upstream: https://github.com/CourtBouillon/css-parsing-tests
Revision: 203ce36bffd617db7f118c551e32794561fb273d (main)
License:  MIT (see LICENSE in this directory)
Fetched:  2026-10-04

These are implementation-independent test cases for CSS parsers, covering the
tokenizer, component values, rules, declarations, An+B, and Color 4. The
normalized copies consumed by `go test` live in the individual package
testdata/ directories and are generated by `cmd/corpusgen`.
